         By the condition $\langle \star\rangle$, we have $a_1 + a_2 + b_3 = 1 - \varphi_{ij}^2 + 1 - \varphi_{jk}^2 + \varphi_{ik} + \varphi_{ij} \varphi_{jk} > 0$.  Hence we have $g_{2,2} > 0$. Dividing both the numerator and the denominator of $T_1(x,y,z)$ by $\rho_{yz}$ gives
