that $(\bb{f},\bb{m})\in\M_{\tilde{\Ls}\vert\bb{A}}(\R,\R^{D})\times\M(\R,\R^{D'})$ verifies \eqref{eq:4.3.69} if and only if $\bb{m}=(\bb{Q}\circ\Ls)\{\bb{f}\}$. The equality of the solution sets is thus verified.
