We fixed $L=2500$ since a larger $L$ simply scales the curve as in Fig.~\ref{fig:check139}. Color code is the same as in Fig.~\ref{fig:check139}. Stars mark the theoretical minimum. Vertical lines denote our estimate of the rate $k$ from experiments.}
