        \frac{1}{2}\sup_{\theta\in [0,1]}\| \langle\u_n^{(3)},\widehat \X_{s_1}\otimes \exp( \theta \widehat  X_{s_1,s_2})\rangle\| \|\widehat  X_{s_1,s_2}\|^2. \nonumber 
