 The claim follows as in the proof of~\ref{3item: lemma 1 i} of Lemma~\ref{3lemma: ito formula uniformly bounded p 23}.

  ~\ref{3item lemma 2 ii}: The assertion follows from~\ref{3item lemma 2 i} and interpolation (see Lemma 5.12 and Lemma 5.27 in~\cite{FV:10}).
