  & =\mathbb{P}\left(\hat{F}_{i,\ell}\big((x_{j,\ell})_{j\in
    A(i)\setminus\{1\}};\,U_{i\ell}\big)=x_{i,\ell+1}, {\forall}\,i\in\mathcal{C}\right) \\
  & \qquad\qquad {\times} \mathbb{P}\left((X_{ik})_{i\in\mathcal{C},\, 1\leq k\leq \ell} =(x_{ik})_{i\in\mathcal{C},\, 1\leq k\leq \ell} \mid (X_{1k})_{1\leq k\leq
